WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.807
A dictionary can contain another dictionary, which lets us organize related fields into sections.

00:00:06.807 --> 00:00:12.832
The employee record contains basic information plus a skills dictionary.

00:00:12.832 --> 00:00:21.320
To reach the Python skill level, we first access skills and then access python inside that nested dictionary.

00:00:21.770 --> 00:00:28.607
Nested structures are common in JSON files and APIs, so learning to follow one key at a time is a useful practical

00:00:28.607 --> 00:00:30.687
skill.
